flowchart LR
 Morning[Family morning / PomPom / shared play] --> Walk[Papa walks Scooby / sit / wait / release]
 Morning --> Play[PinPin and Rabbit / two leaf boats / two birds]
 Walk --> Scent[Forest draft and strange petal]
 Scent --> Mouth[Root tunnel entrance]
 Play --> Rejoin[Sound / shown return / paths rejoin]
 Mouth --> Rejoin
 Rejoin --> Home1[Home / paw care / plan tomorrow]
 Home1 --> Pack[Family packs / supported PomPom / markers]
 Pack --> Lush[Lush chambers / glowberries / echo / picnic]
 Lush --> Clue[Elder listens / observation clue]
 Clue --> Home2[Map / objects / evening routine]
 Home2 --> Water[Follow branches / leaves / forest outlet]
 Water --> Beaver[Beaver's limited clue / route observation]
 Beaver --> Tree[Choose overhead leaf / test one golden circle]
 Tree --> Stop1[Reverse / last drop / source off]
 Stop1 --> Gear[Home / actual shower gear list]
 Gear --> Visit[Final visit / nose and clay / heavy dirt]
 Visit --> Wait[Practiced wait / purposeful pause]
 Wait --> Shower[Packed mat soap brush towels / checked flow]
 Shower --> Wash[Canopy shower / paws / full rinse]
 Wash --> Shake[Pause / enormous shake / varied reactions]
 Shake --> Dry[Dry / brush / carry gear home]
 Dry --> Stop2[Circle already reversed / quiet tree]
 Stop2 --> Farewell[Friends resolved / family returns]
 Farewell --> Door[Whole dog / correct scale / familiar single doorway]
 Door --> Night[Mama and PomPom / story / yawns / cushion / sleep]
